# Oblivious Bookworm: "At the beginning of your end step, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card unless a
# permanent entered the battlefield face down under your control this turn or you turned a permanent face up this
# turn." With no face-down permanent anywhere, the "unless" never holds.
#
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Bookworm off two Moxes and declines its draw at the end step: nothing is drawn and nothing is
# discarded. On turn 3 Bot1 accepts: it draws Counterspell and must discard a card (CR 608.2c: "if you do" is the draw
# having happened), and discards the Counterspell.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Oblivious Bookworm
Island x4
Island
Counterspell
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivious Bookworm.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Decline
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
? Bot1.Library.Count = 12
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Counterspell)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Graveyard = Counterspell
